     "<div><div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"c57\"><div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"c50\"><div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"c49\"><div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"c45\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Hi </span>D-RUG<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">gies! </span><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><div>We will be meeting this Tuesday (2/3) from 10-noon virtually and in \r\nperson in the DataLab classroom (Library 360). This is a group working \r\nsession so come with your questions \r\nfor our expeRts, or just bring your laptop and\r\n get in some distraction free R-coding time. Additionally, if there are \r\ntopics you would like to see someone do a deeper dive on, let us know! <br></div><div><br></div>\r\n</div><div>\r\n<div>D-RUG: 10am-noon, DataLab Classroom, Library 360, and zoom <font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><a href=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09\" title=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(0,134,240)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd%3DS0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464286291000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1bR1Q9wU4iIKbh4jAD-I3x\">https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09</a><br>\r\n</font></div><div><br></div>\r\n</div><div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">Please consider posting your questions to our <a href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group\" title=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(0,134,240)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464286291000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mFALB_gK39_UKs3kbHRBe\">Discourse</a> site\r\n in advance\r\n of attending D-RUG virtually. This helps us do a better job of \r\nanswering your questions, and also keep a log of the types of questions \r\nwe see frequently.</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#1d1d1d\" face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\" style=\"line-height:1.2\">See you then,</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#1d1d1d\" face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\" style=\"line-height:1.2\">Your D-RUG Coo[R]dinators </font></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div></div></div></div></div><br>"
